abstract: >-
  TeNet uses a pretrained language model and a hypernetwork to instantiate
  compact, task-specific robot policies directly from natural-language task
  descriptions. This repository contains the Meta-World experiments released
  with the IJCAI-ECAI 2026 paper.
keywords:
  - language-conditioned control
  - hypernetworks
  - robot learning
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - Meta-World
url: "https://sites.google.com/view/tenet-policy-synthesis"
